WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.520
Ever wondered about the deepest wishes of
SCP-050, a little porcelain rascal also known

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.190
as The Cleverest Monkey?

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:12.079
Foundation researchers took a photo of SCP-050
with the Desire Camera while it sat on the

00:00:12.079 --> 00:00:13.650
desk of a field agent.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.650
What was the result?

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:19.640
“A photo of what appears to be SCP-978,
with a photo emerging from it.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:25.289
The photo is of what appears to be SCP-978,
with a photo emerging from it, ad infinitum.

00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:30.019
Microscopic examination revealed that the
regress continued for 12 levels before details

00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:31.429
became too small to make out.”

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:34.789
Well, that seems pretty on-brand for 050…

